namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamLayerGroup {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamLayerGroup.h#DreamLayerGroup
    src   "Makes the widget's subtree one layer: drawn into a texture of its own, cleared to transparent, then put over what is\nbehind it once -- by its own blend mode, at its own opacity, through its own mask.\n\n- GroupOpacity fades the subtree as one: children that overlap do not show through each other on the way out, as they do\n  when each takes the widget's RenderOpacity.\n- GroupBlendMode blends the whole subtree with what is behind it (EDreamUIBlendMode): a group of a few elements over a\n  picture, in Multiply, darkens it by what the group looks like, not by each element.\n- Inside an isolated group, a child's blend mode blends with what the group has drawn so far, never with what is behind\n  the group.\n- GroupMask masks the group as it is put down, in the widget's rect (FDreamClipMask): a mask of the composite, not of\n  each element. It does not take part in hit tests.\n\nThe texture covers what the subtree draws on the target, and no more, and is the frame's alone: a group costs a texture\nthe size of what it draws, a clear and a full-screen pass over that rect, every frame it is drawn. Groups nest. On a\nworld-space canvas a group is drawn as if passed through, and a warning says so."
    text  "将控件的子树合并为一个图层：绘制到独立纹理中，清除为透明，然后一次性覆盖到其\n背后的内容之上——按自身的混合模式、不透明度、遮罩。\n\n- GroupOpacity 将子树作为一个整体淡出：重叠的子项在淡出时不会互相透出，而各自应用控件的\n  RenderOpacity 时则会如此。\n- GroupBlendMode 将整个子树与其背后的内容混合（EDreamUIBlendMode）：一组元素以 Multiply 叠加在\n  图片上时，是按整个组的外观压暗图片，而不是按每个元素分别压暗。\n- 在隔离组中，子项的混合模式只与组内迄今已绘制的内容混合，绝不与组\n  背后的内容混合。\n- GroupMask 在组落地合成时按控件的矩形遮罩整个组（FDreamClipMask）：遮罩的是合成结果，而不是\n  每个元素。它不参与命中测试。\n\n该纹理只覆盖子树在目标上实际绘制的内容，不多不少，且仅属于当前帧：每绘制一帧，组都要消耗一张与其\n绘制范围同样大小的纹理、一次清除，以及一次覆盖该矩形的全屏通道。组可以嵌套。在世界空间\n画布上，组按穿透方式绘制，并给出警告提示。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayerGroup:bEnabled {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamLayerGroup.h#DreamLayerGroup:bEnabled
    src   "Off, the subtree is drawn as if there were no group: to compare with and without it."
    text  "关闭时，子树如同没有组一样绘制：用于对比有无组时的效果。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayerGroup:GroupBlendMode {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamLayerGroup.h#DreamLayerGroup:GroupBlendMode
