DreamLayerGroup:SetGroupOpacity {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamLayerGroup.h#DreamLayerGroup:SetGroupOpacity
    src   "Applied once to the composited subtree. Changing it redraws nothing but the composite."
